  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="757f30e7-36aa-507c-b981-a99367ef35a5" activityNameId="19bb1818-b446-537d-9aa3-2ee137129e6a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Provision, stubbed land</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Provision, stubbed land
Multi-output process providing the products "round wood, primary forest, clear-cutting, at forest road" and "provision, stubbed land". Emissions from wood burning and land transformation are allocated to the provision of stubbed land.;
UUID: 1f81b86b-6628-3e7f-a93d-804458de6cea
Resources (wood, carbon, land), land transformation, emissions from wood burning, rough estimation for machinery use.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Clear-cutting of primary forests with burning of biomass.
Time period: Publication of data
Production volume: about 2 Mio. ha/a for soy beans
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Rough estimation of machinery use with European forestry data. Emissions profile for tropical forest per kg of dry biomass.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1f81b86b-6628-3e7f-a93d-804458de6cea.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
